Package: tbprogress
Title: Tracking Country Progress Towards the WHO End TB Milestones
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Amisha", "Vatsa", , "amisha.vatsa@aiesec.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides World Health Organization (WHO) estimates of
    tuberculosis (TB) incidence and mortality for 215 countries and
    territories from 2000 to 2023, together with the WHO End TB Strategy
    milestones. Helper functions compare each country's reduction since 2015
    with those milestones and with its WHO region, and a 'shiny' app lets a
    public-health analyst explore whether a country is on track.
